  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Cambodia&#x2019;s human capital landscape as part of its graduation from LDC status.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the foundations of Cambodia&#x2019;s upcoming graduation from LDC status by reinforcing human capital initiatives: supporting people with disabilities, empowering women economically, building opportunities for STEM careers and improving justice reform with a focus on juvenile rights.</narrative>
  </description>
